abstract: An LPJmL-Python interface for operating LPJmL in a Python environment and
  coupling it with Python models, programmes or simple programming scripts. pycoupler
  was written with the aim of establishing the coupling of copan:CORE with LPJmL.
  Coupling with LPJmL is possible on an annual basis, i.e. for each year in which
  LPJmL is in coupling mode, the desired inputs must be passed via pycoupler. LPJmL
  simulates the corresponding year and returns the desired outputs at the end of the
  year. The coupled programme can use the output data to generate new inputs for the
  next year.
